{"product":{"id":8145928913132,"title":"Cortech Endurance Wedge Table - One-Piece Rotationally Molded - Model 484","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe Cortech Endurance Wedge Table is a one-piece, rotationally molded, all-purpose table. The versatile “wedge” design offers various arrangements to accommodate different styles of sitting areas and common spaces. Like the rest of Cortech's Endurance Series Furniture line, the Cortech Endurance wedge table is ideal for continuous use in extreme environments, including compassionate and normative Behavioral Health Care Facilities, Residential Treatment Centers and Facilities, Hospital Psychiatric Units, Correctional Institutions, Mental Health Treatment Centers and other medical and public safety facilities that require the ultimate combination of durability and functional design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable, one-piece, rotationally molded design for increased strength. Constructed of high impact “no break” polyethylene. No steel or wood components\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRaised edge for effortless clean up\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSound dampening\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy to clean, sanitize, and maintain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable options:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModel 484KIT - bolt down kit for floor mounting\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModel 484S has access door to add ballast (not included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlame Retardant (passes Cal 133)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePasses Flammability UL 94 HB\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTested to ISO 22196 showing a \u0026gt;99% reduction in bacteria\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManufactured to ISO Quality Standards in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10 Year Factory Warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Aqua, Black, Blue Gray, Brown, Burgundy, Gray, Green, Indigo, Midnight Blue, Sand, Slate Blue, Stone Gray\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in the USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech Endurance Furniture:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe Cortech Endurance intense use furniture line is ideal for use as behavioral health furniture, correctional facility furniture, detention furniture, and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBehavioral Healthcare \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003emental health furniture. The Endurance Furniture Series is also a perfect fit for residential institutions, public safety facilities, detention centers, correctional institutions, prisons and any intense or high abuse applications such as drug and alcohol rehabilitation centers and addiction treatment centers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech USA:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCortech USA (Correctional Technologies) manufactures products that are exceptionally durable, designed for use in compassionate and normative behavioral healthcare, corrections, law enforcement, heavy use commercial and industrial environments, parks and recreation, schools, universities, hospitals, emergency and homeless shelters, and other institutions and facilities where safety and durability matter. Cortech products are ideal for extreme use and intensive use environments.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Cortech","product_type":"","created_at":"2024-01-23T10:22:12-05:00","handle":"cortech-484-endurance-wedge-table","updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:28:37-05:00","published_at":"2024-01-23T16:28:22-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-activity-rooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-for-waiting-rooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-group-dayrooms, cd-furn-dayroom, cd-furn-lobby, cd-furn-visitation, cortech-endurance, cortech-usa, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":44